= page_heading "Public charging networks"

%p.lead.mb-3.mt-3= "There are #{@networks.size} charging networks being tracked."

%p.mb-4
  Many electric vehicle owners rely on public charging infrastructure to charge
  on a regular basis. Below you'll find a list of all the major charging networks
  along with their typical costs, either by kWh or by minute.

.row.row-cols-1.row-cols-md-3.g-3.mb-3
  - @networks.each do |network|
    .col
      .card
        .card-body
          %h5.card-title= network.name
          %p.card-text= network.description.truncate_words(25)
          = link_to "See the details on #{network.name}", network_path(slug: network.slug), class: 'stretched-link'
